# GEO-100:明寫起算點。外接區間下界是 0,但這裡從 1000 起排,
# 所以 c_0 = 1000 + 400 + 20/2 = 1410,而不是 410。
# 角材 3 錨在 index 0 → footprint u [1397, 1424],錨點角落 u = 1424。
surface 1 origin 0 0 2500 u +x v +y outline 0,0 3600,0 3600,3000 0,3000
grid 1 on 1 u panel 400 gap 20 from 1000
timber 1 20 20 role boundary
timber 2 20 20 role boundary
timber 3 27 33 role primary
place 1 on 1 at-edge e0 +u +n
place 2 on 1 at-edge e2 -u +n
place 3 on 1 at-grid 1 u 0 +v +n
